DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
14711::$$$message_0116_0000_0000$$$::"...I'm tired."[lr]::
14712::$$$message_0116_0000_0001$$$::"...Yeah, I'm tired too."::
14713::$$$message_0116_0001_0000$$$::We both sigh.[lr]::
14714::$$$message_0116_0001_0001$$$::...It's been about two hours since we got in the box.[lr]::
14715::$$$message_0116_0001_0002$$$::My happiness from being close to Tohsaka is starting to get erased by the stuffiness of being trapped.::
14716::$$$message_0116_0002_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14717::$$$message_0116_0002_0001$$$::...Tohsaka must be having more difficulty breathing, being unable to speak.[lr]::
14718::$$$message_0116_0002_0002$$$::She's been repeatedly looking down and slamming her arm with her pinky in frustration.::
14719::$$$message_0116_0003_0000$$$::"...Tohsaka. Should I move more to the corner?"[lr]::
14720::$$$message_0116_0003_0001$$$::"Huh...? You don't have to do that... Besides, that's the farthest you can go, right?"[lr]::
14721::$$$message_0116_0003_0002$$$::"That's true, but... this doesn't feel like a wall to me. If I squeeze my body towards the side, I feel like I can go that much more to the side and make space..."::
14722::$$$message_0116_0004_0000$$$::"What...? Oh, no, don't move![lr]::
14723::$$$message_0116_0004_0001$$$::Even if you were able to make space, the size of the box won't change. If you make space by yourself, the balance of the size will get messed up."::
14724::$$$message_0116_0005_0000$$$::"I see. But, are you okay like this?[lr]::
14725::$$$message_0116_0005_0001$$$::...You seem to be in pain."[lr]::
14726::$$$message_0116_0005_0002$$$::"...No need to worry. It's not like I'm in pain from being claustrophobic."[lr]::
14727::$$$message_0116_0005_0003$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
14728::$$$message_0116_0005_0004$$$::In that case, what other reason is there to be irritated about?::
14729::$$$message_0116_0006_0000$$$::...Thirty more minutes pass.[lr]::
14730::$$$message_0116_0006_0001$$$::Tohsaka's visibly starting to lose her mind.[lr]::
14731::$$$message_0116_0006_0002$$$::She must be stressed out.[lr]::
14732::$$$message_0116_0006_0003$$$::I'm also starting to become unable to fully extend my arms and legs, and it's not like it's particularly humid, but the fact that the temperature inside the box is going up is getting me worried too.::
14733::$$$message_0116_0007_0000$$$::"It's almost 1 PM... Are you okay, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
14734::$$$message_0116_0007_0001$$$::"I-I'm...[small]not okay.[rf][lr]::
14735::$$$message_0116_0007_0002$$$::...You're rather calm."[lr]::
14736::$$$message_0116_0007_0003$$$::There's no energy in her response.[lr]::
14737::$$$message_0116_0007_0004$$$::...This is bad. I was optimistic that Saber or Sakura would come if another hour passed, but that doesn't seem to be the case.::
14738::$$$message_0116_0008_0000$$$::"[line len=3]All right.[lr]::
14739::$$$message_0116_0008_0001$$$::Tohsaka. There's just one more thing I want to try."[lr]::
14740::$$$message_0116_0008_0002$$$::"What... is it?"::
14741::$$$message_0116_0009_0000$$$::"You know how when I came inside this room, you said you were rocking the box, right?[lr]::
14742::$$$message_0116_0009_0001$$$::I was able to see the box moving from the outside."::
14743::$$$message_0116_0010_0000$$$::"So that means that sound from the inside of the box was cut off, but I was able to feel the vibration and hear the sound of the box hitting the floor."[lr]::
14744::$$$message_0116_0010_0001$$$::"[line len=3]Can you say the conclusion already?"::
14745::$$$message_0116_0011_0000$$$::"It's the opposite from usual.[lr]::
14746::$$$message_0116_0011_0001$$$::In other words, you shouldn't try to open the lid from the inside.[lr]::
14747::$$$message_0116_0011_0002$$$::If we roll this treasure box and if the lid gets stuck on something, I figured it would open from the outside[line len=3]"::
14748::$$$message_0116_0012_0000$$$::I read Tohsaka's face.[lr]::
14749::$$$message_0116_0012_0001$$$::I thought she would fire reasons one after another to turn it down.::
14750::$$$message_0116_0013_0000$$$::"Yeah, that would be better than relying on [font italic=true]that[font italic=false]."[lr]::
14751::$$$message_0116_0013_0001$$$::"That? There's other ways?"[lr]::
14752::$$$message_0116_0013_0002$$$::"N-Never mind![lr]::
14753::$$$message_0116_0013_0003$$$::Let's go with your idea then, it's decided!"::
14754::$$$message_0116_0014_0000$$$::Tohsaka seems to be distracted and acting weird.[lr]::
14755::$$$message_0116_0014_0001$$$::She's acting so hyper and frantic that it makes me tilt my head in confusion.::
14756::$$$message_0116_0015_0000$$$::"...Whatever.[lr]::
14757::$$$message_0116_0015_0001$$$::Let's roll it from the right side over there."[lr]::
14758::$$$message_0116_0015_0002$$$::"Got it[line len=3][cacheimage storage=凛私服16e(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][shock vmax=40 time=600 count=-5][se storage=se054 nowait=1][chgfg pos=c time=300 storage=凛私服16e(近)]hnng...!"[lr]::
14759::$$$message_0116_0015_0003$$$::I thrust my body and become one with the box.[lr]::
14760::$$$message_0116_0015_0004$$$::As we sync our movements and shift the center of gravity, the world tilts.::
14761::$$$message_0116_0016_0000$$$::"Hnng... Woah!?"[wvs][se storage=se296.wav][lr]::
14762::$$$message_0116_0016_0001$$$::The treasure box starts rolling.[lr]::
14763::$$$message_0116_0016_0002$$$::All right, good[line len=3]::
14764::$$$message_0116_0017_0000$$$::"No way, [wvl][move textoff=0 opacity=255 base=凛私服16e(近)b cx=294 layer=0 py=375 px=596 affine=(502,184,106.219,1,255,294,267) time=300 cy=267 mag=1 deg=28.926 accel=0]AH[line len=3]!"[wvs][se storage=se529.wav][lr]::
14765::$$$message_0116_0017_0001$$$::No, it's not![lr]::
14766::$$$message_0116_0017_0002$$$::Inside the box [se storage=se045.wav]as it rolls, [se storage=se151.wav]it transforms into an unbearable ride...![se storage=se138.wav]::
14767::$$$message_0116_0018_0000$$$::"You touched me! [wvl][se storage=se073.wav]With your hand just now!"[wvs][se storage=se528.wav][lr]::
14768::$$$message_0116_0018_0001$$$::"It was an irresistible force!"[lr]::
14769::$$$message_0116_0018_0002$$$::"Hey, [wvl][se storage=se057.wav]where are you putting your head!?"[wvs][se storage=se530.wav][lr]::
14770::$$$message_0116_0018_0003$$$::"I said it was an [wvl][se storage=se422.wav]irresistible force!"::
14771::$$$message_0116_0019_0000$$$::"Hey! [wvl][se storage=se529.wav]Don't punch me!"[lr]::
14772::$$$message_0116_0019_0001$$$::"You're striking it lucky, [wvl][se storage=se110.wav]so let me punch you at least once!"[wvs][se storage=se115.wav][lr]::
14773::$$$message_0116_0019_0002$$$::"Guh, it's already the third one, [wvl][se storage=se150.wav]this is just abuse!"::
14774::$$$message_0116_0020_0000$$$::"Ow..."[lr]::
14775::$$$message_0116_0020_0001$$$::"H-Hey, are you okay?"[lr]::
14776::$$$message_0116_0020_0002$$$::"I'm okay, I just cut the tip of my finger."[lr]::
14777::$$$message_0116_0020_0003$$$::[line len=3]I feel the sharp edges of broken glass.::
14778::$$$message_0116_0021_0000$$$::"Hm... They broke.[lr]::
14779::$$$message_0116_0021_0001$$$::I have to remake it, ugh, an unexpected expense..."[lr]::
14780::$$$message_0116_0021_0002$$$::Tohsaka's glasses... They're still on the floor.[lr]::
14781::$$$message_0116_0021_0003$$$::But, thanks to us moving this much,[lr]::
14782::$$$message_0116_0021_0004$$$::[line len=3]the lid is still closed.::
14783::$$$message_0116_0022_0000$$$::"It... didn't work?"[lr]::
14784::$$$message_0116_0022_0001$$$::"No way...[lr]::
14785::$$$message_0116_0022_0002$$$::W-Wahhh..."[lr]::
14786::$$$message_0116_0022_0003$$$::Tohsaka must be in shock that we weren't able to escape, as she lets out a groan.[lr]::
14787::$$$message_0116_0022_0004$$$::Have we tried everything we can?::
14788::$$$message_0116_0023_0000$$$::"But well... If the treasure box is turned over weirdly, then it should be easier to notice for whoever comes by.[lr]::
14789::$$$message_0116_0023_0001$$$::All we can do is wait for someone to come[line len=3]"[lr]::
14790::$$$message_0116_0023_0002$$$::"No, [cacheimage storage=凛私服14d(近)][wvl][se volume=70 storage=se082.wav][shock vmax=30 time=500 count=-4][chgfg pos=c textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服14d(近)]we don't have time to leave it up to fate like that! We can only wait for thirty more minutes!"[lr]::
14791::$$$message_0116_0023_0003$$$::Tohsaka glares at me with bloodshot eyes.::
14792::$$$message_0116_0024_0000$$$::...That seems like an awfully clear time limit.[lr]::
14793::$$$message_0116_0024_0001$$$::Thirty more minutes... Is that because October 11th will end...? No, it can't be.::
14794::$$$message_0116_0025_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
14795::$$$message_0116_0025_0001$$$::I feel my way through.[lr]::
14796::$$$message_0116_0025_0002$$$::I can tell right away that it's a unique shape.[lr]::
14797::$$$message_0116_0025_0003$$$::A wand with wings.[lr]::
14798::$$$message_0116_0025_0004$$$::The one that Tohsaka was particular about[line len=3]::
14799::$$$message_0116_0026_0000$$$::[font italic=true]...Huh?[font italic=false][lr]::
14800::$$$message_0116_0026_0001$$$::Something's lit up, but that is...[lr]::
14801::$$$message_0116_0026_0002$$$::There's no doubt. It's [font italic=true]that[font italic=false] stick.[lr]::
14802::$$$message_0116_0026_0003$$$::...When I think back, we ended up in this situation because of that wand.::
14803::$$$message_0116_0027_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14804::$$$message_0116_0027_0001$$$::...But, I wonder why it's lit up.[lr]::
14805::$$$message_0116_0027_0002$$$::...Is it because we're in a dark box?[lr]::
14806::$$$message_0116_0027_0003$$$::The ordinary red light is more ominous than ever... Better yet, it's starting to look promising...::
14807::$$$message_0116_0028_0000$$$::"Guh! No, pull your hand back, Shirou!"[lr]::
14808::$$$message_0116_0028_0001$$$::"Hrrk!?"[lr]::
14809::$$$message_0116_0028_0002$$$::I come to my senses from Tohsaka's reprimand![lr]::
14810::$$$message_0116_0028_0003$$$::I was about to pick up that wand.::
14811::$$$message_0116_0029_0000$$$::"...That was close... Give me a break. We're already running out of time. Don't add onto the trouble any further."[lr]::
14812::$$$message_0116_0029_0001$$$::Tohsaka drops her shoulders.[lr]::
14813::$$$message_0116_0029_0002$$$::On the contrary, the mysterious wand seems to disappointingly dim its shine.::
14814::$$$message_0116_0030_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14815::$$$message_0116_0030_0001$$$::How suspicious.[lr]::
14816::$$$message_0116_0030_0002$$$::I thought it was just some toy all this time, but now it's exceptionally suspicious.[lr]::
14817::$$$message_0116_0030_0003$$$::...It also seems to be releasing a lot of magical energy.::
14818::$$$message_0116_0031_0000$$$::"...Tohsaka. What is that wand?[lr]::
14819::$$$message_0116_0031_0001$$$::Is it some kind of cursed item?"[lr]::
14820::$$$message_0116_0031_0002$$$::"...Haah. Yeah, I guess it would be bad if I didn't tell you at this point.[lr]::
14821::$$$message_0116_0031_0003$$$::...I don't really want to talk about it, but this wand is called a Kaleidostick.[lr]::
14822::$$$message_0116_0031_0004$$$::It's a Mystic Code that Zelretch made just like this box, and it's like a magic booster that supplies a vast amount of magical energy to the user that makes a contract with it."::
14823::$$$message_0116_0032_0000$$$::"Zelretch again... So, does that mean that wand can use 2nd True Magic too?"[lr]::
14824::$$$message_0116_0032_0001$$$::"...Well, yeah. It seems like it, but..."[lr]::
14825::$$$message_0116_0032_0002$$$::She's not very articulate.[lr]::
14826::$$$message_0116_0032_0003$$$::Maybe Tohsaka doesn't know the truth behind the Kaleido-whatever either. Wait, but...::
14827::$$$message_0116_0033_0000$$$::"Then, why are you treating it like something so dangerous?[lr]::
14828::$$$message_0116_0033_0001$$$::Oh, well, it's got a lot of magical energy, and I'm only getting a bad feeling from it, so it's clear that it's something cursed."::
14829::$$$message_0116_0034_0000$$$::"...This thing gave me hell in the past.[lr]::
14830::$$$message_0116_0034_0001$$$::Since then, I've been careful not to activate it no matter what... [cacheimage storage=凛私服08d(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服08d(近)]This is bad, it seems like it awakened since I spilled my blood earlier.[lr]::
14831::$$$message_0116_0034_0002$$$::C'mon. Enough with the pretending to be asleep, you bad spirit."[lr]::
14832::$$$message_0116_0034_0003$$$::"[line len=3]What?"::
14833::$$$message_0116_0035_0000$$$::Tohsaka glares at the wand that gives off a dull red light.[lr]::
14834::$$$message_0116_0035_0001$$$::The Kaleidostick flickers, as if chuckling.::
14835::$$$message_0116_0036_0000$$$::"Heh[line len=3]heheheh, how excellent, Rin![lr]::
14836::$$$message_0116_0036_0001$$$::You have (rather annoyingly) matured that much in only six years![cacheimage storage=カレイドステッキ(あおり)][wvl canskip=0 time=600][wm canskip=0][se storage=se083.wav][movefg opacity=255 left=2 top=-722 time=300 accel=3 storage=カレイドステッキ(あおり)][wm canskip=0][move time=300 path=(118,49,128)(118,-46,255)(118,28,255)(118,2,255) storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)01b accel=-2][wvl canskip=0 time=400][stophaze][se storage=irse003.wav][playstop time=200 nowait=1][sestop storage=se167.wav time=100 nowait=1][dash textoff=0 hidefg=0 mx=0 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=400 imag=6.1 time=1000 cy=300 mag=1 my=0 storage=ルビーちゃん感激です rot=-0.0 accel=0] Ruby is impressed!"::
14837::$$$message_0116_0037_0000$$$::"[line len=3]What?"[lr]::
14838::$$$message_0116_0037_0001$$$::Some girl's voice[line len=2]that's cheerful yet mischievous, mature yet girly, and sounds like she would look good in an apron[line len=2]echoes throughout my head.::
14839::$$$message_0116_0038_0000$$$::"...You haven't changed as much. You were covered in dust for six years, so you could be reflecting on yourself a bit more."[lr]::
14840::$$$message_0116_0038_0001$$$::"No, no worries. I have reflected enough.[lr]::
14841::$$$message_0116_0038_0002$$$::I will not allow for my owner to do something as half-hearted as getting scared and running away from now on. [wvl][move textoff=0 time=150 path=(347,10,255)(347,54,255)(347,34,255) storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)02 accel=0 spline=0]Yes, you're doomed once you've made your contract. I shall show you that I will follow you around until my (owner's) death!"[cacheimage storage=049_黒炎][wvs][wm canskip=0][fg opacity=0 textoff=0 left=445 mono=1 color=0x00e89e17 index=4000 top=-52 time=100 storage=049_黒炎]::
14842::$$$message_0116_0039_0000$$$::The Kaleidostick argues heatedly, yet dependably.[lr]::
14843::$$$message_0116_0039_0001$$$::Their words sound like German, but the meaning comes flowing like frank Japanese. It's strange.[lr]::
14844::$$$message_0116_0039_0002$$$::"...It's totally strange.[lr]::
14845::$$$message_0116_0039_0003$$$::Tohsaka. It seems like a wand is talking to me."::
14846::$$$message_0116_0040_0000$$$::"It is talking. Genuinely. This is a talking wand."[lr]::
14847::$$$message_0116_0040_0001$$$::"Oh, excuse me there.[lr]::
14848::$$$message_0116_0040_0002$$$::Nice to meet you, Shirou. My name is Magical Ruby, a man-made natural spirit that can speak for the Kaleidostick's functions, guiding principles, and emotions.[lr]::
14849::$$$message_0116_0040_0003$$$::Please feel free to call me Ruby[heart]"::
14850::$$$message_0116_0041_0000$$$::"...I see. Thank you for thoroughly explaining."[lr]::
14851::$$$message_0116_0041_0001$$$::...All right.[lr]::
14852::$$$message_0116_0041_0002$$$::The sweet voice is deceiving, but that thing is dangerous. It seems like it's an invincible character from the fact that it's natural even though it's man-made, and the magical energy that's released is as poisonous as radioactivity.[lr]::
14853::$$$message_0116_0041_0003$$$::First of all, nothing that is named "Magical" in this world is decent...!::
14854::$$$message_0116_0042_0000$$$::"Familiar or not, we won't have any business with you for eternity. Give up and sleep already.[lr]::
14855::$$$message_0116_0042_0001$$$::It was just a coincidence that you got covered in blood.[lr]::
14856::$$$message_0116_0042_0002$$$::Even if I were to be locked in this box for the rest of my life, I don't have the slightest intention of making a contract with you."::
14857::$$$message_0116_0043_0000$$$::"All right then.[lr]::
14858::$$$message_0116_0043_0001$$$::I shall be aware of your order."[lr]::
14859::$$$message_0116_0043_0002$$$::The Kaleidostick smiles.[lr]::
14860::$$$message_0116_0043_0003$$$::...Oh, they actually understand.::
14861::$$$message_0116_0044_0000$$$::"Then, let us quickly resolve this with some negotiation![lr]::
14862::$$$message_0116_0044_0001$$$::Now, now. Hurry up and make a contract with me.[lr]::
14863::$$$message_0116_0044_0002$$$::I cannot sleep in peace by myself [wvl][move textoff=0 time=90 path=(347,10,255)(347,54,255)(347,34,255)(347,10,255)(347,54,255)(347,34,255) storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)01b accel=0 spline=0]even though you two are in a tight spot!"[lr]::
14864::$$$message_0116_0044_0003$$$::Or rather...[lr]::
14865::$$$message_0116_0044_0004$$$::We can't even carry a conversation one bit.::
14866::$$$message_0116_0045_0000$$$::"You still don't have a receiving function, you stupid wand... Whatever. I will [font italic=true]never, ever[font italic=false] make a contract with you again."[lr]::
14867::$$$message_0116_0045_0001$$$::Tohsaka turns her face.[lr]::
14868::$$$message_0116_0045_0002$$$::Oh, she kicked it.::
14869::$$$message_0116_0046_0000$$$::"...No, more importantly, Tohsaka, by again, you mean[line len=2]"[lr]::
14870::$$$message_0116_0046_0001$$$::"Yes. I've made a contract with this thing before.[lr]::
14871::$$$message_0116_0046_0002$$$::It's what you would call mistakes made from your youth. After my father passed away, I found this thing as I was sorting through his belongings. There was a manual, and when I made a contract wondering what it was..."[lr]::
14872::$$$message_0116_0046_0003$$$::"...What happened once you made a contract?[lr]::
14873::$$$message_0116_0046_0004$$$::Don't tell me your body got taken over or something..."::
14874::$$$message_0116_0047_0000$$$::"...The thing is, I can't remember anything."[lr]::
14875::$$$message_0116_0047_0001$$$::"You don't remember?"::
14876::$$$message_0116_0048_0000$$$::"Yeah. When I came to my senses, I was lying on the floor, the wand was inside the box, and there was just a note written to myself that said to 'never use that stupid wand ever again.'"[lr]::
14877::$$$message_0116_0048_0001$$$::"So you don't have any memory of right after you used the wand to when you let go of it... So, what other actual damage was there?"::
14878::$$$message_0116_0049_0000$$$::"...I have no idea. But from that day on, I lost my friends.[lr]::
14879::$$$message_0116_0049_0001$$$::...Of course I was sticking through as an overachiever, so they all kept their distance from me. They all seemed to run away from me with eyes like they were looking at something scary or crazy."::
14880::$$$message_0116_0050_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14881::$$$message_0116_0050_0001$$$::What happened during that blank gap of hours?[lr]::
14882::$$$message_0116_0050_0002$$$::So the only ones that know the truth are Tohsaka's friends at the time and this wand.[lr]::
14883::$$$message_0116_0050_0003$$$::"...I see... Either way, that means we shouldn't involve ourselves with it."[lr]::
14884::$$$message_0116_0050_0004$$$::That thing's definitely a cursed item.::
14885::$$$message_0116_0051_0000$$$::"No, it's a misunderstanding, Shirou![lr]::
14886::$$$message_0116_0051_0001$$$::The reason that Rin lost her friends was her own fault. That was not my responsibility!"[lr]::
14887::$$$message_0116_0051_0002$$$::"It's not a matter of a misunderstanding.[lr]::
14888::$$$message_0116_0051_0003$$$::If you're going to plead innocence, then be clear about what you did to me and what happened that day."::
14889::$$$message_0116_0052_0000$$$::"All you did was go out to town and went onstage at the park that everyone gathers at.[lr]::
14890::$$$message_0116_0052_0001$$$::Like an idol from the 1980s. [cacheimage storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)04][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)04]Like, "Hey everyone, thanks for gathering for me today!"[cacheimage storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)02][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)02] That kind of thing.[lr]::
14891::$$$message_0116_0052_0002$$$::Everyone was totally turned off by it, but you seemed like you were having fun from start to finish[heart]"::
14892::$$$message_0116_0053_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14893::$$$message_0116_0053_0001$$$::What is this mental trauma that just hurts to think about?::
14894::$$$message_0116_0054_0000$$$::"...I-I know that. I captured one of the kids running away and asked about it. The problem is why I did such a thing."[lr]::
14895::$$$message_0116_0054_0001$$$::"Oh, the reason is clear.[lr]::
14896::$$$message_0116_0054_0002$$$::You used me and transformed into 'Rin that's good at singing.'"[lr]::
14897::$$$message_0116_0054_0003$$$::"[line len=3]Huh?"::
14898::$$$message_0116_0055_0000$$$::"Yes. You were adorable that day.[lr]::
14899::$$$message_0116_0055_0001$$$::You were feeling down that you were laughed at from hiccuping at the best part while you were singing.[lr]::
14900::$$$message_0116_0055_0002$$$::'I have to be the best at singing,' [wvl canskip=0 time=400]you said. I was touched by you crying while practicing, [cacheimage storage=カレイドステッキ(あおり),カレイドステッキ(マイルド)02][wvl][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=0 top=152 time=200 accel=2 storage=カレイドステッキ(あおり)][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=-594 top=-44 time=200 accel=0 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)02][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=0 top=-36 time=8000 accel=0 storage=カレイドステッキ(あおり)]so I thought that I should toy with you, [wvl canskip=0 time=500]I mean, be of help to you."::
14901::$$$message_0116_0056_0000$$$::"T-The details don't matter![lr]::
14902::$$$message_0116_0056_0001$$$::W-What? That's the most terrifying phrase in the world. Transforming into a 'me that's good at singing'!?"::
14903::$$$message_0116_0057_0000$$$::"Like I said, transforming is transforming.[lr]::
14904::$$$message_0116_0057_0001$$$::I am the Kaleidostick, the happy Mystic Code like no other that was made by Zelretch, who travels through parallel worlds![lr]::
14905::$$$message_0116_0057_0002$$$::Shall I call this ability 'Prism Trance'?[lr]::
14906::$$$message_0116_0057_0003$$$::I am a lyrical item of nightmares that can allow the user, Rin, to change her skills with another Rin!"::
14907::$$$message_0116_0058_0000$$$::[font italic=true]...Huh?[font italic=false][lr]::
14908::$$$message_0116_0058_0001$$$::[font italic=true]The skills of another Tohsaka, with this Tohsaka... What?[font italic=false]::
14909::$$$message_0116_0059_0000$$$::"...No way. So, you actually mean I transformed!?"[lr]::
14910::$$$message_0116_0059_0001$$$::"Heh heh heh. As expected of the family head of the Tohsaka family, you understood my explanation well. [l][say storage=cty0224_maj_0101 name=マジカルルビー][wm canskip=0][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)01b][chgfg textoff=0 time=100 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)01a][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)01b]Ruby is surprised. [l][say storage=cty0224_maj_0102 name=マジカルルビー][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03]Really I wanted to keep it vague like this. [move textoff=0 time=180 path=(348,36,255)(348,19,255) storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03 accel=-2]Teehee."::
14911::$$$message_0116_0060_0000$$$::She smiles saying she gives up... A voice like that...belongs to Kaleidostick, no, Magical Ruby.[lr]::
14912::$$$message_0116_0060_0001$$$::I repeat, but just her voice is catastrophically adorable.::
14913::$$$message_0116_0061_0000$$$::"...No, don't get fooled.[lr]::
14914::$$$message_0116_0061_0001$$$::Hey, Tohsaka. What was that about?"[lr]::
14915::$$$message_0116_0061_0002$$$::"...Like it said, a transformation.[lr]::
14916::$$$message_0116_0061_0003$$$::It's hard to believe, but this wand... The Kaleidostick is an item that can transform the user."::
14917::$$$message_0116_0062_0000$$$::"For example, I try to brew you some delicious tea. But I can't brew tea well.[lr]::
14918::$$$message_0116_0062_0001$$$::In that moment, all I have to do is wave the wand once and voilà.[lr]::
14919::$$$message_0116_0062_0002$$$::I turn into 'Rin Tohsaka who is an expert at brewing tea' that must be in a parallel universe and will be able to brew delicious tea.[lr]::
14920::$$$message_0116_0062_0003$$$::No, to be exact, I can borrow just that skill for a moment."::
14921::$$$message_0116_0063_0000$$$::"I see... So you can download just the ability you need... Right?"[lr]::
14922::$$$message_0116_0063_0001$$$::"Huh? Download?"::
14923::$$$message_0116_0064_0000$$$::"Yes. Putting Rin who is behind the times aside, that is correct, Shirou.[lr]::
14924::$$$message_0116_0064_0001$$$::The Rin in this world may be old-fashioned, but there may be a high-tech Rin in another parallel universe.[lr]::
14925::$$$message_0116_0064_0002$$$::I take the exterior of the high-tech Rin and dress it on this Rin.[lr]::
14926::$$$message_0116_0064_0003$$$::As a result, Rin can become an electronics expert in just one second, yes."::
14927::$$$message_0116_0065_0000$$$::"Wow, that is..."[lr]::
14928::$$$message_0116_0065_0001$$$::Incredible.[lr]::
14929::$$$message_0116_0065_0002$$$::That means you can call various "what-ifs" of Tohsaka, and she can become a specialist in that field!::
14930::$$$message_0116_0066_0000$$$::"[line len=3]However. There are several rules to this. [lr]::
14931::$$$message_0116_0066_0001$$$::Impersonations start with style.[lr]::
14932::$$$message_0116_0066_0002$$$::When she uses Prism Trance, I will have Rin wear clothes that are suitable for that form."::
14933::$$$message_0116_0067_0000$$$::"Yet for some reason, no one likes that. Thanks to that, I've only had two Masters in the past, present, and future."[lr]::
14934::$$$message_0116_0067_0001$$$::Magical Ruby hides her tears with the sleeve of her kimono.[lr]::
14935::$$$message_0116_0067_0002$$$::Well, the kimono is just my imagination.::
14936::$$$message_0116_0068_0000$$$::"Why? That much is nothing to complain about."[lr]::
14937::$$$message_0116_0068_0001$$$::"...![lr]::
14938::$$$message_0116_0068_0002$$$::Y-You don't mean that you[line len=2]!"::
14939::$$$message_0116_0069_0000$$$::"Yes. So, a suitable costume.[lr]::
14940::$$$message_0116_0069_0001$$$::If you want to pour tea, then a maid uniform.[lr]::
14941::$$$message_0116_0069_0002$$$::If you want to become amphibious Rin Tohsaka, then a school swimsuit.[lr]::
14942::$$$message_0116_0069_0003$$$::And for the pitiful you who wanted to be good at singing, I provided a totally gothic Lolita outfit!"::
14943::$$$message_0116_0070_0000$$$::"Guh...!"[lr]::
14944::$$$message_0116_0070_0001$$$::T-That means she's unmistakably a magical girl...!!!::
14945::$$$message_0116_0071_0000$$$::"Oh, by the way, as for the call to transform, I chose what would be the most embarrassing at the time[heart][lr]::
14946::$$$message_0116_0071_0001$$$::Oh dear, everyone at the park was pale at that point."[lr]::
14947::$$$message_0116_0071_0002$$$::"Y-[wvl][shock vmax=30 time=400 count=-5]You stupid wand, so that's why my friend network got reset!!!"::
14948::$$$message_0116_0072_0000$$$::...The terrifying truth that was revealed just now.[lr]::
14949::$$$message_0116_0072_0001$$$::The identity of the item that uses 2nd True Magic, the magic wand that grants girls' wishes, is a costume box where you get into character both mentally and physically.[lr]::
14950::$$$message_0116_0072_0002$$$::Ah, a dark magic that has never been easier to tell just by looking.[lr]::
14951::$$$message_0116_0072_0003$$$::[line len=3]Of course there's a reason no one would want to make a contract with it.[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][se storage=se075.wav][se storage=se067.wav][se storage=se231.wav][quake vmax=30 hmax=10 time=1500][se storage=se072.wav][se storage=se045.wav]::
14952::$$$message_0116_0073_0000$$$::"Anyway, let's think of another method for now.[lr]::
14953::$$$message_0116_0073_0001$$$::Pull yourself together. Refresh your mind. Completely ignore the loud thing."[lr]::
14954::$$$message_0116_0073_0002$$$::"Whattt? That's mean. Make a contract with me, Rin. I've already taken your blood sample, so all you have to do is say yes[line len=3]"::
14955::$$$message_0116_0074_0000$$$::"Look. Completely ignore it, Emiya.[lr]::
14956::$$$message_0116_0074_0001$$$::Whether it's the Mystic Code of the 2nd True Magic or whether it already registered my blood doesn't matter.[lr]::
14957::$$$message_0116_0074_0002$$$::As long as you don't pick it up, it'll turn off after a certain amount of time, then it's goodbye. We need to seal such a dangerous thing at the bottom of this box for eternity."[cacheimage storage=ガーンa][wvs][fg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=531 index=3000 top=68 time=100 storage=ガーンa]::
14958::$$$message_0116_0075_0000$$$::"Nooo. Wahh, such cruel treatment... I just wanted to fight for justice with Rin..."[lr]::
14959::$$$message_0116_0075_0001$$$::The wand cries.[lr]::
14960::$$$message_0116_0075_0002$$$::...Just as Tohsaka says, the wand will return to how it originally was if we keep on ignoring it.::
14961::$$$message_0116_0076_0000$$$::"...I feel bad, though.[lr]::
14962::$$$message_0116_0076_0001$$$::Isn't it okay to at least keep it outside, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
14963::$$$message_0116_0076_0002$$$::Also, the phrase "for justice" sounded familiar.[lr]::
14964::$$$message_0116_0076_0003$$$::"Hrrk!"::
14965::$$$message_0116_0077_0000$$$::"You're being too soft! You don't know what kind of means it'll use to approach me to form a contract if you let it out.[lr]::
14966::$$$message_0116_0077_0001$$$::Or what? Are you okay with a pervert that calls herself a magical girl appearing in Fuyuki City one day?"[lr]::
14967::$$$message_0116_0077_0002$$$::"...Mrgh."[lr]::
14968::$$$message_0116_0077_0003$$$::That's a difficult question.[lr]::
14969::$$$message_0116_0077_0004$$$::...I'm a guy too. Honestly, I kind of want to see it but I also don't want to...::
14970::$$$message_0116_0078_0000$$$::[line len=3]So...[lr]::
14971::$$$message_0116_0078_0001$$$::"Ugh, you're so persistent![lr]::
14972::$$$message_0116_0078_0002$$$::What kind of salesperson are you!?"[lr]::
14973::$$$message_0116_0078_0003$$$::"No, no, I can't beat your stubbornness.[lr]::
14974::$$$message_0116_0078_0004$$$::You won't say yes even though I'm offering you this much of a deal, [cacheimage storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03][wvl][wm canskip=0][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03]Ruby is extremely troubled."::
14975::$$$message_0116_0079_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14976::$$$message_0116_0079_0001$$$::The Magical Ruby's voice echoes inside the locked box.[lr]::
14977::$$$message_0116_0079_0002$$$::The box's temperature goes up from the heated argument. The discomfort index of Tohsaka, who was already irritated, is swelling up like the sun.::
14978::$$$message_0116_0080_0000$$$::"Fine. [wvl][move textoff=0 time=130 path=(349,-4,255)(349,33,255)(349,-18,255)(349,15,255) storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)02 accel=0 spline=1]At this point, I shall put in my best effort![lr]::
14979::$$$message_0116_0080_0001$$$::I shall even give you the proof of a first-class magical girl, a mascot friend, for free! [l][say storage=cty0224_maj_0202 name=マジカルルビー][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03,凛私服09d(近)]You're so good at bargaining, Rin!"[lr]::
14980::$$$message_0116_0080_0002$$$::"Rahhh![lr]::
14981::$$$message_0116_0080_0003$$$::I haven't been bargaining with you from the start!"::
14982::$$$message_0116_0081_0000$$$::Tohsaka shouts hysterically.[lr]::
14983::$$$message_0116_0081_0001$$$::...This is definitely not good. We need to call for help as soon as possible.[lr]::
14984::$$$message_0116_0081_0002$$$::Not to get out of this box, but to get away from this wand.::
14985::$$$message_0116_0082_0000$$$::"Oh, by the way, what kind of personality type do you like?[lr]::
14986::$$$message_0116_0082_0001$$$::A small-animal type full of wildness, a slightly mature fairy type,[lr]::
14987::$$$message_0116_0082_0002$$$::a classy spirit type who guides young girls, [cacheimage storage=カレイドステッキ(あおり)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=カレイドステッキ(あおり) last=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03][move textoff=0 time=250 path=(264,-62,255)(264,20,255) storage=カレイドステッキ(あおり) accel=-2 spline=0][se volume=60 storage=se170.wav]a giant transforming fusion robot type,[lr]::
14988::$$$message_0116_0082_0003$$$::and so on and so forth. Shall I meet your various needs?"::
14989::$$$message_0116_0083_0000$$$::"...I'm fine with the way things are right now."[lr]::
14990::$$$message_0116_0083_0001$$$::Since it's bothersome.[lr]::
14991::$$$message_0116_0083_0002$$$::You're a silly enough mascot type even without having to create some weird character.::
14992::$$$message_0116_0084_0000$$$::"Oh my."[lr]::
14993::$$$message_0116_0084_0001$$$::...It must've sounded like a compliment, as Magical Ruby sounds happy.[lr]::
14994::$$$message_0116_0084_0002$$$::I'll repeat this persistently, but just her voice is adorable without a doubt.::
14995::$$$message_0116_0085_0000$$$::"C'mon, Rin, Shirou is saying so too![lr]::
14996::$$$message_0116_0085_0001$$$::Why don't you just make a contract with me without worrying about anything?[lr]::
14997::$$$message_0116_0085_0002$$$::You'll easily be able to pry open the box that old geezer... [cacheimage storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03][wvl canskip=0 time=500][wm canskip=0][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03]Ahem, I mean, [cacheimage storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)04][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)04]Zelretch made."::
14998::$$$message_0116_0086_0000$$$::"Ahaha, I'd rather die.[lr]::
14999::$$$message_0116_0086_0001$$$::If you want to form a contract that badly, why don't you make one with your beloved Shirou who's been talking to you in such a friendly manner?"[lr]::
15000::$$$message_0116_0086_0002$$$::"I would love to, but I am a Mystic Code limited to women. I have already taken your blood and registered you as a Master, [cacheimage storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)04][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)04]so you know, you'd really be rescuing me[line len=2]"::
15001::$$$message_0116_0087_0000$$$::"Shut up. We're the ones that want to be rescued.[lr]::
15002::$$$message_0116_0087_0001$$$::Ugh, I'm already at my breaking point...!"[lr]::
15003::$$$message_0116_0087_0002$$$::"Oh, that is right.[lr]::
15004::$$$message_0116_0087_0003$$$::You will wet yourself if you aren't honest."[lr]::
15005::$$$message_0116_0087_0004$$$::In an instant.[lr]::
15006::$$$message_0116_0087_0005$$$::The temperature inside the box switches to below zero.::
15007::$$$message_0116_0088_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
15008::$$$message_0116_0088_0001$$$::"A little 'accident,' if you will?[lr]::
15009::$$$message_0116_0088_0002$$$::It is natural for a human body and an unavoidable system. [cacheimage storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)01a][wvl][chgfg lv2off=1 textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)01a]But it can't be helped. If you count from before you were waiting for Shirou, you'll have been holding it for four hours already."::
15010::$$$message_0116_0089_0000$$$::"[line len=12]Oh. Oh, oh, oh..."[lr]::
15011::$$$message_0116_0089_0001$$$::Tohsaka shakes.[lr]::
15012::$$$message_0116_0089_0002$$$::And she'll act violently. She'll act extremely violently in a second.::
15013::$$$message_0116_0090_0000$$$::I bet...[lr]::
15014::$$$message_0116_0090_0001$$$::"Eheheheheheheh![lr]::
15015::$$$message_0116_0090_0002$$$::Yes, that's right, that's the punchline anyway, it's my fault for drinking tea before sorting through the things, I'm the one who has descended from the proper Tohsakas...!"[lr]::
15016::$$$message_0116_0090_0003$$$::Or like...::
15017::$$$message_0116_0091_0000$$$::"But I can't die alone![lr]::
15018::$$$message_0116_0091_0001$$$::No, in fact, goodbye humanity! If that happens, I'll destroy you along with the rest of the world...![lr]::
15019::$$$message_0116_0091_0002$$$::Yes, so for that reason, you should clench your teeth, Emiya...!"[lr]::
15020::$$$message_0116_0091_0003$$$::Or something like that. It's not hard to imagine.::
15021::$$$message_0116_0092_0000$$$::Tohsaka awkwardly looks ashamed.[lr]::
15022::$$$message_0116_0092_0001$$$::I can painfully understand how she feels, and I'm the one who should feel ashamed.[lr]::
15023::$$$message_0116_0092_0002$$$::...At this time. If I was more carefree and outgoing, then I could ignore it like it was nothing.::
15024::$$$message_0116_0093_0000$$$::"...Sorry, Tohsaka. I wasn't being considerate."[lr]::
15025::$$$message_0116_0093_0001$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
15026::$$$message_0116_0093_0002$$$::I try to sound as earnest as possible. If I act embarrassed here, then Tohsaka will be even more embarrassed.::
15027::$$$message_0116_0094_0000$$$::"I was only thinking about the time.[lr]::
15028::$$$message_0116_0094_0001$$$::...No, let's quit talking about this topic and just think about getting out right now. Just watch. I'll get us out of this box in no time."[lr]::
15029::$$$message_0116_0094_0002$$$::That was the best that I could do.[lr]::
15030::$$$message_0116_0094_0003$$$::I can't help but be aware of it, but it's way better than awkwardly trying to laugh it off.::
15031::$$$message_0116_0095_0000$$$::"Y-Yeah... You're...right.[lr]::
15032::$$$message_0116_0095_0001$$$::I was also worrying about it too much."[lr]::
15033::$$$message_0116_0095_0002$$$::"Haha. I'm thick-headed, that much is true."[lr]::
15034::$$$message_0116_0095_0003$$$::"...That's not true. I'm seeing you in a different light a little."::
15035::$$$message_0116_0096_0000$$$::"I see, that's good."[lr]::
15036::$$$message_0116_0096_0001$$$::I feel more relaxed.[lr]::
15037::$$$message_0116_0096_0002$$$::It must be because Tohsaka's mood got calmer.[lr]::
15038::$$$message_0116_0096_0003$$$::I can't help but...::
15039::$$$message_0116_0097_0000$$$::"But, you could've said so if that was the case.[lr]::
15040::$$$message_0116_0097_0001$$$::I would've Projected a bedpan or two."[lr]::
15041::$$$message_0116_0097_0002$$$::...casually dig my own grave.::
15042::$$$message_0116_0098_0000$$$::"You're more nasty than thick-headed, you airhead!"::
15043::$$$message_0116_0099_0000$$$::"Ouch!"[lr]::
15044::$$$message_0116_0099_0001$$$::Stars spin around my head.[lr]::
15045::$$$message_0116_0099_0002$$$::It's not a metaphor.[lr]::
15046::$$$message_0116_0099_0003$$$::There were actually stars spinning around my head just now...!::
15047::$$$message_0116_0100_0000$$$::"T-Tohsaka, your hand, your hand...![lr]::
15048::$$$message_0116_0100_0001$$$::Y-You're holding the stick!"[lr]::
15049::$$$message_0116_0100_0002$$$::"O-OH CRAAAAAP!!! [cacheimage storage=凛私服16e(近)][wvl][chgfg bluroff=1 textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服16e(近)]I couldn't help but grab it since there was something conveniently nearby[line len=3]!"::
15050::$$$message_0116_0101_0000$$$::"Heheheh[line len=3]heheheheh, this is just as I had planned![lr]::
15051::$$$message_0116_0101_0001$$$::It is impressive how much of a fool you are, that Rin can't stop herself from beating you with a blunt weapon![lr]::
15052::$$$message_0116_0101_0002$$$::That is why you are the perfect partner for Rin!"::
15053::$$$message_0116_0102_0000$$$::"Khh...! Over something this ridiculous[line len=3]dammit, I won't lose...!"[lr]::
15054::$$$message_0116_0102_0001$$$::"That is pointless, I have gathered all the necessary elements for a contract![lr]::
15055::$$$message_0116_0102_0002$$$::Master authentication by blood, the contract of utilization by touch, and[line len=3]I have definitely received the energy needed to activate![lr]::
15056::$$$message_0116_0102_0003$$$::Oh, please sign the invoice here."::
15057::$$$message_0116_0103_0000$$$::The devil wand shines.[lr]::
15058::$$$message_0116_0103_0001$$$::But... Tohsaka hasn't given it any energy...!::
15059::$$$message_0116_0104_0000$$$::"...Don't be...ridiculous...I didn't...send...magical energy[line len=3]"[lr]::
15060::$$$message_0116_0104_0001$$$::"Heheheh, magical energy is not what is needed to activate the Kaleidostick.[lr]::
15061::$$$message_0116_0104_0002$$$::What's needed is [cacheimage storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)01b][wvl][wm canskip=0][stoplquake storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)01a][chgfg textoff=0 time=100 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)01b][shock vmax=30 time=300 count=-4]love! [cacheimage storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03][wvl canskip=0 time=600][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 fliplr=1 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03][move textoff=0 time=100 path=(54,14,255)(28,6,255)(58,15,255)(33,6,255)(58,15,255)(33,6,255) storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03 accel=0]And that is the super feminine power for girls who can't be honest towards the thick-headed men who they like!"[lr]::
15062::$$$message_0116_0104_0003$$$::"Haha... What the hell... [wvl][move textoff=0 opacity=255 storage=凛私服05h(近) cx=447 py=334 px=633 affine=(1040,600,-28.301,1,0,447,288) time=600 cy=288 mag=1 deg=+0.0 accel=3]I wanna die..."[wvs][wm canskip=0][se storage=se192.wav][quake vmax=30 hmax=0 time=600]::
15063::$$$message_0116_0105_0000$$$::"Hey, don't lose, Tohsaka! Leave it to me!"[lr]::
15064::$$$message_0116_0105_0001$$$::I can only use brute force at this point. I'll snatch the wand from Tohsaka's hand![lr]::
15065::$$$message_0116_0105_0002$$$::"That won't happen![wm canskip=0][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 left=0 top=600 time=300 accel=2 storage=カレイドステッキ(あおり)][cacheimage storage=08魔術・電撃,カレイドステッキ(マイルド)04,カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03][wvl canskip=0 time=200][move textoff=0 spread=1 mx=400 magnify=1 time=800 my=1478 path=(400,-882,255,0.9)(400,-436,255,0.7)(400,665,255,0.5) storage=カレイドステッキ accel=-3] Kaleido[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][textoff][se storage=se023.wav][movefg opacity=255 time=100 pos=c accel=0 storage=08魔術・電撃][movefg opacity=255 left=-33 top=-62 time=100 accel=0 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)04][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=200][movefg opacity=0 time=600 pos=c accel=0 storage=08魔術・電撃][movefg opacity=0 left=-33 top=-62 time=1500 accel=0 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)04][wait canskip=0 time=400][se storage=se023.wav][movefg opacity=255 time=300 pos=c accel=0 storage=08魔術・電撃][movefg opacity=255 left=219 top=-77 time=300 accel=0 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=300][movefg opacity=0 time=800 pos=c accel=0 storage=08魔術・電撃][movefg opacity=0 left=219 top=-77 time=800 accel=0 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03][se storage=se387.wav][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][wvl canskip=0 time=200][dash mx=0 opacity=255 layer=all irot=-0.0 cx=400 imag=6 time=200 cy=290 mag=2 my=0 rot=-0.0 accel=2][quake vmax=30 hmax=0 time=600] beaaam!"[lr]::
15066::$$$message_0116_0105_0003$$$::"Wahhhhhh!!![lr]::
15067::$$$message_0116_0105_0004$$$::A-Anything goes for this thingggggg!!!"::
15068::$$$message_0116_0106_0000$$$::...A rough wind brushes my cheek.[lr]::
15069::$$$message_0116_0106_0001$$$::I wonder how much time passed since then.[lr]::
15070::$$$message_0116_0106_0002$$$::No, how much distance did I travel from my hometown?[lr]::
15071::$$$message_0116_0106_0003$$$::At the end of the gap of many months and years, I wake up in a world too beyond human intellect.[lr]::
15072::$$$message_0116_0106_0004$$$::[line len=3]What loneliness.[lr]::
15073::$$$message_0116_0106_0005$$$::I'm like a lone machine that was sent to the frontier.::
15074::$$$message_0116_0107_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
15075::$$$message_0116_0107_0001$$$::A wasteland surrounds me as far as I can see.[lr]::
15076::$$$message_0116_0107_0002$$$::I'm standing by myself on an unfamiliar planet that is clearly not Earth.[lr]::
15077::$$$message_0116_0107_0003$$$::...How should I say this?[lr]::
15078::$$$message_0116_0107_0004$$$::My reasoning is also reaching its limit in this nonsensical atmosphere.::
15079::$$$message_0116_0108_0000$$$::"Welcome to the magical planet of dreams![lr]::
15080::$$$message_0116_0108_0001$$$::Heheheh, I welcome you, Shirou...!"[lr]::
15081::$$$message_0116_0108_0002$$$::The mysterious object squeals.::
15082::$$$message_0116_0109_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
15083::$$$message_0116_0109_0001$$$::Now, I'm starting to finally understand how Tohsaka feels.[lr]::
15084::$$$message_0116_0109_0002$$$::Also I'm starting to get how to deal with that thing.[lr]::
15085::$$$message_0116_0109_0003$$$::To explain the alien called Magical Ruby...[lr]::
15086::$$$message_0116_0109_0004$$$::You will never be able to reason with it.::
15087::$$$message_0116_0110_0000$$$::"...Okay, so anything goes for you, huh?[lr]::
15088::$$$message_0116_0110_0001$$$::So. Where are we?"[lr]::
15089::$$$message_0116_0110_0002$$$::"I said it's the magical planet.[lr]::
15090::$$$message_0116_0110_0003$$$::The farthest land of those who love justice... It looks like that, but it's actually the inside of the Kaleidostick."::
15091::$$$message_0116_0111_0000$$$::"Ahh. So it's basically your imagined scenery, huh?"[lr]::
15092::$$$message_0116_0111_0001$$$::"Yes[humming] As expected of you, you're quick to understand things when it comes to Bounded Fields[heart]"[lr]::
15093::$$$message_0116_0111_0002$$$::This is horrible.[lr]::
15094::$$$message_0116_0111_0003$$$::This must be a knockoff of the Reality Marble.::
15095::$$$message_0116_0112_0000$$$::"I'm not one to talk about others, but this is tasteless.[lr]::
15096::$$$message_0116_0112_0001$$$::You must not have any friends."[lr]::
15097::$$$message_0116_0112_0002$$$::"B-Bull's-eye...![lr]::
15098::$$$message_0116_0112_0003$$$::Wahh, how cold... I invited you since I thought we resonated with each other."[lr]::
15099::$$$message_0116_0112_0004$$$::"...Resonated with each other?"[lr]::
15100::$$$message_0116_0112_0005$$$::I ask her with distaste.::
15101::$$$message_0116_0113_0000$$$::"Oh c'mon, Shirou. And I thought you already knew[heart][lr]::
15102::$$$message_0116_0113_0001$$$::You are a champion of justice, and I am a magical girl of justice.[lr]::
15103::$$$message_0116_0113_0002$$$::See, we are both beings that love justice.[lr]::
15104::$$$message_0116_0113_0003$$$::So, I want to cooperate together and team up with you to produce Rin Tohsaka, that corrupted devil, as the magical girl of justice, but[line len=2]"::
15105::$$$message_0116_0114_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
15106::$$$message_0116_0114_0001$$$::The exit...is nowhere to be found.[lr]::
15107::$$$message_0116_0114_0002$$$::But there's no way this nonsensical world can last long. It should only be able to last one more minute.::
15108::$$$message_0116_0115_0000$$$::"You there, please don't look around![lr]::
15109::$$$message_0116_0115_0001$$$::Look, I am saying this for the sake of the people too. I am not forcing Rin out of my own self-interest.[lr]::
15110::$$$message_0116_0115_0002$$$::I said so earlier too, but the command that is engraved deep down inside me is 'love and power'!"::
15111::$$$message_0116_0116_0000$$$::The out-of-place artifact puffs her chest saying that she isn't suspicious.[lr]::
15112::$$$message_0116_0116_0001$$$::"Hey, if you're going to say that, isn't it 'love and peace'?"[lr]::
15113::$$$message_0116_0116_0002$$$::"Yes, that is correct! Love wins in the end for humans after all![lr]::
15114::$$$message_0116_0116_0003$$$::Yes, love and power... It's got such a self-righteous ring to it.[lr]::
15115::$$$message_0116_0116_0004$$$::I think it is a wonderful reason to exist if I do say so myself!"::
15116::$$$message_0116_0117_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
15117::$$$message_0116_0117_0001$$$::...It's the real thing.[lr]::
15118::$$$message_0116_0117_0002$$$::The way she says "power" instead of "peace" is fitting for a dangerous Seal Designation-class item.::
15119::$$$message_0116_0118_0000$$$::"So, I would like for Rin to become an evangelist for love and power on my behalf for the peace of the people.[lr]::
15120::$$$message_0116_0118_0001$$$::I am merely a sad magic item. No matter how much power I have, I can't do anything unless people use me.[lr]::
15121::$$$message_0116_0118_0002$$$::Besides, don't you also have a problem with Rin's everyday actions? Rin should make use of her abundant (comedic) talent for everyone!"::
15122::$$$message_0116_0119_0000$$$::"...I want to be able to relate a bit to that opinion, but..."[lr]::
15123::$$$message_0116_0119_0001$$$::I can't trust that thing after all. [wait canskip=0 time=1000]I mean, its true feelings are completely spilling out![lr]::
15124::$$$message_0116_0119_0002$$$::I don't know if it's because Zelretch hastily added this function realizing that this thing is crazy, or if it's because its method of communicating is through telepathy. But, I can clearly hear Ruby's true, unadulterated feelings through the parentheses!::
15125::$$$message_0116_0120_0000$$$::"Now, there really isn't any time left! Please let me hear your answer as a fellow comrade who loves justice![lr]::
15126::$$$message_0116_0120_0001$$$::Ruby believes that you will be my companion...!"[lr]::
15127::$$$message_0116_0120_0002$$$::"...Okay. 'Love and power,' is it? Let's say that it's real.[lr]::
15128::$$$message_0116_0120_0003$$$::Hey, Ruby. What kind of thing is justice to you?"::
15129::$$$message_0116_0121_0000$$$::"What? Hmm, let's see...[lr]::
15130::$$$message_0116_0121_0001$$$::Equality in the world and to make it more fun (for me) I suppose."[lr]::
15131::$$$message_0116_0121_0002$$$::"...Then, what is evil to you, Ruby?"::
15132::$$$message_0116_0122_0000$$$::"Ahaha, oh please, Shirou.[lr]::
15133::$$$message_0116_0122_0001$$$::Obviously anything that goes against me is evil."[lr]::
15134::$$$message_0116_0122_0002$$$::"Guh...!"[lr]::
15135::$$$message_0116_0122_0003$$$::S-So that statement is something that doesn't have to be hidden within itself!!!???::
15136::$$$message_0116_0123_0000$$$::"Hey, we're done talking here, you [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]devil![lr]::
15137::$$$message_0116_0123_0001$$$::Give Tohsaka back! Return me to the original world! I'm not gonna put up with your tricks anymore!"::
15138::$$$message_0116_0124_0000$$$::"...No... I thought I could get along with you as fellow champions of justice... But it is too late![lr]::
15139::$$$message_0116_0124_0001$$$::Right now, I am having Rin understand (by force) the greatness of justice, and our contract will be complete in a few more seconds![lr]::
15140::$$$message_0116_0124_0002$$$::Oh, but just to let you know, I can't undo the contract.[lr]::
15141::$$$message_0116_0124_0003$$$::My contract is mostly a curse because it was endorsed by the old man Zelretch[heart]"::
15142::$$$message_0116_0125_0000$$$::"Khh...!"[lr]::
15143::$$$message_0116_0125_0001$$$::[font italic=true]You bastard, withdrawing when it gets inconvenient for you...![font italic=false][lr]::
15144::$$$message_0116_0125_0002$$$::[font italic=true]But don't underestimate me, it's not like I keep on getting involved in trouble just for show...![font italic=false]::
15145::$$$message_0116_0126_0000$$$::"[line len=3]Hup!"[lr]::
15146::$$$message_0116_0126_0001$$$::I put my hands on the ground and look up at the sky with all my might.[lr]::
15147::$$$message_0116_0126_0002$$$::The most efficient way to get out of a nightmare is not by escaping from that world, but obviously by annihilating yourself!::
15148::$$$message_0116_0127_0000$$$::"[line len=3]Tohsaka!"[lr]::
15149::$$$message_0116_0127_0001$$$::I get pulled back from the nightmare.[lr]::
15150::$$$message_0116_0127_0002$$$::Tohsaka is[line len=3][rep fliplr=0 tops=,37 storages=凛私服16e(近),カレイドステッキ(マイルド)01a time=600 flipud=0 lefts=,-61 poss=rc, bg=i黒背景-(深夜) indexes=1000,2000]as expected of her, she's still holding out...!::
15151::$$$message_0116_0128_0000$$$::"Tohsaka, give me that wand...!"[lr]::
15152::$$$message_0116_0128_0001$$$::I try to snatch the wand from Tohsaka's hand... But I can't!?[lr]::
15153::$$$message_0116_0128_0002$$$::"Khh...!"[lr]::
15154::$$$message_0116_0128_0003$$$::The Kaleidostick flashes.[lr]::
15155::$$$message_0116_0128_0004$$$::"Heheheh, the contract is complete!"[lr]::
15156::$$$message_0116_0128_0005$$$::"Dammit, did I not make it in time...!?"::
15157::$$$message_0116_0129_0000$$$::"No, there is no problem, Emiya.[lr]::
15158::$$$message_0116_0129_0001$$$::Magical Ruby is a spirit of justice. There's not even the slightest mistake in her actions.[lr]::
15159::$$$message_0116_0129_0002$$$::I am the magical girl of justice. There is not a single thing correct with my behavior.[lr]::
15160::$$$message_0116_0129_0003$$$::Yes... Not even counterattacks will be allowed for the villains who disobey."[lr]::
15161::$$$message_0116_0129_0004$$$::"Eeek...! W-What do you mean, 'curse'? That's just brainwashing, you stupid spirit...!"::
15162::$$$message_0116_0130_0000$$$::"Ugh, just let go of it![lr]::
15163::$$$message_0116_0130_0001$$$::Just pass that wand over to me, Tohsaka!"[lr]::
15164::$$$message_0116_0130_0002$$$::I'll break it into pieces with my knee!::
15165::$$$message_0116_0131_0000$$$::"[line len=3]Calm down, Emiya.[lr]::
15166::$$$message_0116_0131_0001$$$::There is no need to worry at all. We're the ones who were thoughtless.[lr]::
15167::$$$message_0116_0131_0002$$$::Yeah. A magical girl is good. What is there to be embarrassed about when fighting for the sake of love and power?"[lr]::
15168::$$$message_0116_0131_0003$$$::"Sleep, it's a nightmare![lr]::
15169::$$$message_0116_0131_0004$$$::I'm not one to talk, but that's probably embarrassing!"::
15170::$$$message_0116_0132_0000$$$::"Poor Emiya.[lr]::
15171::$$$message_0116_0132_0001$$$::I can't believe you still don't understand the greatness of the Kaleidostick... Those who only believe in justice are no good after all."::
15172::$$$message_0116_0133_0000$$$::"But don't worry, I won't abandon you or anything. You're my important companion[heart][lr]::
15173::$$$message_0116_0133_0001$$$::From now on, whether it's getting rejected by a favorite Senpai, or a rich rival girl transferring to our school from the magical world, we're going to overcome hardships together!"::
15174::$$$message_0116_0134_0000$$$::"Ah[line len=3]Ahh, ahhhhh..."[lr]::
15175::$$$message_0116_0134_0001$$$::There's no use anymore.[lr]::
15176::$$$message_0116_0134_0002$$$::I'm not able to stop this catastrophe.[lr]::
15177::$$$message_0116_0134_0003$$$::I want to run out as soon as possible.[lr]::
15178::$$$message_0116_0134_0004$$$::Not from this box, but from this Tohsaka.::
15179::$$$message_0116_0135_0000$$$::"Now, let's go, Shero![lr]::
15180::$$$message_0116_0135_0001$$$::Compact Full Open! Mirror World Circuits: maximum engage![lr]::
15181::$$$message_0116_0135_0002$$$::Der Spiegelform wird fertig zum Transport[line len=3]!"[lr]::
15182::$$$message_0116_0135_0003$$$::"Ja, meine Meisterin...![lr]::
15183::$$$message_0116_0135_0004$$$::Offnunug des Kaleidoskopsgatter[line len=3]!"::
15184::$$$message_0116_0136_0000$$$::"Thanks for waiting! Magical girl Kaleido Ruby is born![lr]::
15185::$$$message_0116_0136_0001$$$::[line len=3]How was that, Shero? Pretty good for my first transformation, right!?"[lr]::
15186::$$$message_0116_0136_0002$$$::"...Yeah. It's more shocking than good.[lr]::
15187::$$$message_0116_0136_0003$$$::By the way, what's up with that weird way of[line len=3]"::
15188::$$$message_0116_0137_0000$$$::I was about to say "saying my name."[lr]::
15189::$$$message_0116_0137_0001$$$::Then I feel some indescribable feeling of discomfort in my body.[lr]::
15190::$$$message_0116_0137_0002$$$::Like when my limbs became like a stuffed toy's when Illya pulled a prank on me...::
15191::$$$message_0116_0138_0000$$$::"It's your name when you transform.[lr]::
15192::$$$message_0116_0138_0001$$$::It's the heroine's partner that's expected to come along with a magical girl."[lr]::
15193::$$$message_0116_0138_0002$$$::Kaleido Ruby points to me.[lr]::
15194::$$$message_0116_0138_0003$$$::"W-W-W-What[line len=3]!?"::
15195::$$$message_0116_0139_0000$$$::"W-W-W-[wvl][stoplquake layer=all][shock vmax=30 time=400 count=-3]What the hell is this!?"[lr]::
15196::$$$message_0116_0139_0001$$$::"Well, I did confirm with you. I asked you which mascot type you prefer.[lr]::
15197::$$$message_0116_0139_0002$$$::Oh, by the way, I reused the name that another Master was using, so please accept my apologies."::
15198::$$$message_0116_0140_0000$$$::"Guh, so the mascot friend wasn't about you!?"[lr]::
15199::$$$message_0116_0140_0001$$$::"Huh? [cacheimage storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg fliplr=1 bluroff=1 textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)03]Ahaha, of course not, Shirou.[lr]::
15200::$$$message_0116_0140_0002$$$::Did you think that I would act under someone?"[lr]::
15201::$$$message_0116_0140_0003$$$::What a splendid self-analysis.::
15202::$$$message_0116_0141_0000$$$::"Well, now that's settled, we need to hurry and get out of this box![whitestar] The world is waiting for our success! As soon as possible! With more power than the sun! Giving strawberry bloodsoaked love to the troubled children throughout the world!::
15203::$$$message_0116_0142_0000$$$::"That is right, my Master![lr]::
15204::$$$message_0116_0142_0001$$$::Next week on episode one of the new show, 'Magical Girl Kaleido Ruby,'[lr]::
15205::$$$message_0116_0142_0002$$$::Burn up, burning drug! A struggle to the death: Golden Crescent[line len=2]3,000 Meters Up in the Sky!', a Scarlet Scad is blasting off!"[lr]::
15206::$$$message_0116_0142_0003$$$::What a brain-dead title.::
15207::$$$message_0116_0143_0000$$$::A vortex of magical energy converges.[lr]::
15208::$$$message_0116_0143_0001$$$::This amount of magical energy, which is enough to fill the treasure box that's cramped up but endless, condenses into the Kaleidostick.::
15209::$$$message_0116_0144_0000$$$::"Open, Schweinorg![lr]::
15210::$$$message_0116_0144_0001$$$::To the place I desire, the way that I desire![lr]::
15211::$$$message_0116_0144_0002$$$::Here we go, Sesam, offne dich!"[lr]::
15212::$$$message_0116_0144_0003$$$::"Ahhh[whitestar] How lovely, my Master![lr]::
15213::$$$message_0116_0144_0004$$$::I did it! [cacheimage storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)01b][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレイドステッキ(マイルド)01b]I got the first person, the red one!"::
15214::$$$message_0116_0145_0000$$$::[line len=3]The lid that shouldn't be able to open at all from the inside opens.[lr]::
15215::$$$message_0116_0145_0001$$$::The blinding light, and the abundant magical energy completely disappears.[lr]::
15216::$$$message_0116_0145_0002$$$::This is a moment that is inherently imperceptible.[lr]::
15217::$$$message_0116_0145_0003$$$::The boundary between inside the box and the outside, the single moment where we return from nonsensical time to normal time.::
15218::$$$message_0116_0146_0000$$$::"[line len=3]Thank you.[lr]::
15219::$$$message_0116_0146_0001$$$::Thanks to you, Shirou, it seems like I will finally be able to fulfill the purpose that I was made for."::
15220::$$$message_0116_0147_0000$$$::It thanks me.[lr]::
15221::$$$message_0116_0147_0001$$$::"...You're welcome.[lr]::
15222::$$$message_0116_0147_0002$$$::So. What will happen to Tohsaka?"::
15223::$$$message_0116_0148_0000$$$::"There is no need to worry.[lr]::
15224::$$$message_0116_0148_0001$$$::As long as my contract is fulfilled, I will take my leave.[lr]::
15225::$$$message_0116_0148_0002$$$::From now on, I will not appear like this anymore, and the 'persuasion' from my contract will completely wear off the moment you go outside."::
15226::$$$message_0116_0149_0000$$$::"Huh? So, you are[line len=2]"::
15227::$$$message_0116_0150_0000$$$::"Yes, this is goodbye. From here on, I will enjoy watching the success of you two as a Kaleidostick.[lr]::
15228::$$$message_0116_0150_0001$$$::Farewell. I wish you both happiness."::
15229::$$$message_0116_0151_0000$$$::"Oh[line len=3]"[lr]::
15230::$$$message_0116_0151_0001$$$::The presence of the Kaleidostick fades.[lr]::
15231::$$$message_0116_0151_0002$$$::...Could it be that it actually wasn't that bad?[lr]::
15232::$$$message_0116_0151_0003$$$::The man-made spirit that dragged us around that much disappeared easily...::
15233::$$$message_0116_0152_0000$$$::"...So.[lr]::
15234::$$$message_0116_0152_0001$$$::Will Tohsaka have the memory of when she was Kaleido Ruby?"[lr]::
15235::$$$message_0116_0152_0002$$$::"Yes. I clearly left it this time[heart]"[lr]::
15236::$$$message_0116_0152_0003$$$::...They really were like the devil until the end.::
15237::$$$message_0116_0153_0000$$$::We roll onto the soft carpet.[lr]::
15238::$$$message_0116_0153_0001$$$::The air feels cool and comfortable.[lr]::
15239::$$$message_0116_0153_0002$$$::There really was a lot that happened, but we were finally able to come back to the outside world[line len=3]::
15240::$$$message_0116_0154_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
15241::$$$message_0116_0154_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
15242::$$$message_0116_0154_0002$$$::We were able to come back, but Issei and Mitsuzuri are right in front of us.::
15243::$$$message_0116_0155_0000$$$::"Y-Yo. Oh yeah, today's Sunday, huh?[lr]::
15244::$$$message_0116_0155_0001$$$::Oh, I came over earlier."[lr]::
15245::$$$message_0116_0155_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
15246::$$$message_0116_0155_0003$$$::There's no response. Or rather, they're too shocked to reply.[lr]::
15247::$$$message_0116_0155_0004$$$::They're looking behind me.::
15248::$$$message_0116_0156_0000$$$::"Hey, thanks for waiting, everyone! The Prism Make Up of Kaleido Ruby, the executor of love and power, is starting[cacheimage storage=カレイドルビー01bステッキ_ラメ(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレイドルビー01bステッキ_ラメ(中)]...?"[lr]::
15249::$$$message_0116_0156_0001$$$::...That's right. That is right.[lr]::
15250::$$$message_0116_0156_0002$$$::Excuses are useless for that person there. If there were a hundred people, a hundred people would be stunned. She is unmistakably a magical girl...!::
15251::$$$message_0116_0157_0000$$$::"Huh... Oh... Um... [wvl][shock vmax=10 time=400 count=-5]Haha, ha..."[lr]::
15252::$$$message_0116_0157_0001$$$::Tohsaka, whose brainwashing got undone and regained her consciousness, is trembling.[lr]::
15253::$$$message_0116_0157_0002$$$::She chews over her actions from earlier and her current state like she's on a bed of nails[line len=3][lr]::
15254::$$$message_0116_0157_0003$$$::"...It's okay, you can laugh."::
15255::$$$message_0116_0158_0000$$$::"Guh, gahahahahaha![rf][lr]::
15256::$$$message_0116_0158_0001$$$::What is that, Tohsaka, ahahahahahaha!"[lr]::
15257::$$$message_0116_0158_0002$$$::"...Heh. As expected of you, Ayako, you have no mercy... Heheh, ahaha..."[cacheimage storage=一成私服01b(遠)][wvs][fg textoff=0 left=882 index=1000 top=56 time=100 storage=一成私服01b(遠)]::
15258::$$$message_0116_0159_0000$$$::"Tohsaka."[lr]::
15259::$$$message_0116_0159_0001$$$::"What? Why don't you laugh if you want to laugh?[lr]::
15260::$$$message_0116_0159_0002$$$::In fact, you should laugh."::
15261::$$$message_0116_0160_0000$$$::"Is that your performance for the cultural festival?[lr]::
15262::$$$message_0116_0160_0001$$$::But the student council hasn't received a request form saying that class 3-A is doing a play..."[lr]::
15263::$$$message_0116_0160_0002$$$::...As usual, Issei is calm.[lr]::
15264::$$$message_0116_0160_0003$$$::He's kind to people, and he's even being kind to Tohsaka today of all days.::
15265::$$$message_0116_0161_0000$$$::"Nice, you look cute, Tohsaka, that's great![lr]::
15266::$$$message_0116_0161_0001$$$::How blessed our planning committee is to have you preparing such an eye-popping performance![wvl][quake vmax=20 hmax=0 time=1500] Ahahahahaha!"[lr]::
15267::$$$message_0116_0161_0002$$$::And Mitsuzuri laughs so much that she has difficulty breathing even though she's her best friend.::
15268::$$$message_0116_0162_0000$$$::"Huh, cultural festival...?"[lr]::
15269::$$$message_0116_0162_0001$$$::"Oh yeah, that's why we gathered..."[lr]::
15270::$$$message_0116_0162_0002$$$::It was a blessing in disguise.[lr]::
15271::$$$message_0116_0162_0003$$$::It seems like we were barely able to ditch the rumor of Rin Tohsaka being a magical girl.::
15272::$$$message_0116_0163_0000$$$::"Having a fitting session with just you and Emiya... I'll have to question you about that later.  [lr]::
15273::$$$message_0116_0163_0001$$$::That's quite some magic trick for two humans to come out of that small box."::
15274::$$$message_0116_0164_0000$$$::Issei's eyes light up, filled with awe.[lr]::
15275::$$$message_0116_0164_0001$$$::Even when he doesn't get along with Tohsaka, he praises great accomplishments.[fg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=719 index=2000 top=132 time=100 storage=美綴私服02b(遠)]::
15276::$$$message_0116_0165_0000$$$::"Well, I wasn't expecting you to aim to get Miss Homurahara three years in a row with such a clever scheme like this.[lr]::
15277::$$$message_0116_0165_0001$$$::Oh man, how cute. Ahaha, you look super cute!"[lr]::
15278::$$$message_0116_0165_0002$$$::"Y[line len=3][cacheimage storage=カレイドルビー02bステッキ(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=カレイドルビー02bステッキ(中)]Yes, it wouldn't be fun if I were to win...every year...the same...way."::
15279::$$$message_0116_0166_0000$$$::"Hm, I've slandered you, calling you things like a sly fox or a wolf in sheep's clothing, but I must apologize.[lr]::
15280::$$$message_0116_0166_0001$$$::For you to throw away your model student image yourself to make the cultural festival more fun... Seeing you challenge yourself is very much like you, even if you are my enemy."::
15281::$$$message_0116_0167_0000$$$::"Yeah, this year seems like it'll be fun.[lr]::
15282::$$$message_0116_0167_0001$$$::Matou's been gaining popularity in the last six months, so it might cause a big upset."[lr]::
15283::$$$message_0116_0167_0002$$$::"Hahaha, hahahaha, [cacheimage storage=o遠坂邸外観-(昼)][wvl canskip=0 time=1000][fadein textoff=0 storage=o遠坂邸外観-(昼) time=300][stopdash]hahahahahahahahahahahaha..."::
15284::$$$message_0116_0168_0000$$$::"Huh, Sakura is that popular?"[lr]::
15285::$$$message_0116_0168_0001$$$::"Oh, I can't pass over this. Are you on Tohsaka or Matou's side?"[lr]::
15286::$$$message_0116_0168_0002$$$::"Huh...!?"::
15287::$$$message_0116_0169_0000$$$::"Matou is an important junior to you.[lr]::
15288::$$$message_0116_0169_0001$$$::As someone in a neutral standpoint, I can't favor only Tohsaka.[lr]::
15289::$$$message_0116_0169_0002$$$::I need to tell Matou your preference. But well, I guess it's hard no matter how much you try. Tohsaka's a magical girl after all, a magical girl! Man, I want to try becoming one!"[cacheimage storage=カレイドルビー02e_モノクロ(中)][wvs][fg textoff=0 opacity=0 index=1000 time=100 pos=c storage=カレイドルビー02e_モノクロ(中)]::
15290::$$$message_0116_0170_0000$$$::This is bound to give me heart issues, but it's still going.[lr]::
15291::$$$message_0116_0170_0001$$$::Mitsuzuri laughs, and Issei stands there, impressed.[lr]::
15292::$$$message_0116_0170_0002$$$::As a result, Tohsaka wasn't able to change until the two left, and she now has to participate in the cultural festival meeting as Kaleido Ruby.[lr]::
15293::$$$message_0116_0170_0003$$$::...Of course. As per the conversation, she has no other choice but to participate in the pageant like that.::
15294::$$$message_0116_0171_0000$$$::"They finally left.[lr]::
15295::$$$message_0116_0171_0001$$$::Well. The trouble over this box is settled."[lr]::
15296::$$$message_0116_0171_0002$$$::I clean up the table on behalf of Tohsaka, who hasn't moved at all since earlier.::
15297::$$$message_0116_0172_0000$$$::"Huh? Heyyy, Tohsakaaa.[lr]::
15298::$$$message_0116_0172_0001$$$::It's fine, everything got settled. More importantly, what happened in the box..."[lr]::
15299::$$$message_0116_0172_0002$$$::"...I'll resent you. I'm going to resent you no matter what. It's all your fault."[lr]::
15300::$$$message_0116_0172_0003$$$::"Guh."::
15301::$$$message_0116_0173_0000$$$::It wasn't resolved at all.[lr]::
15302::$$$message_0116_0173_0001$$$::Even though we escaped from the box and finally became free after Issei and Mitsuzuri left, Tohsaka is still trembling.[lr]::
15303::$$$message_0116_0173_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
15304::$$$message_0116_0173_0003$$$::...I'm worried.[lr]::
15305::$$$message_0116_0173_0004$$$::So it was that rough after all.::
15306::$$$message_0116_0174_0000$$$::"Mrgh. But you can't blame me for everything.[lr]::
15307::$$$message_0116_0174_0001$$$::I did do my best to save you from Magical Ruby..."::
15308::$$$message_0116_0175_0000$$$::"C-Come on, at least let me say that much![lr]::
15309::$$$message_0116_0175_0001$$$::First of all, if you hadn't said such a stupid thing, I wouldn't have picked up that stupid wand...![lr]::
15310::$$$message_0116_0175_0002$$$::You stupid duo! [wvl][wshock canskip=0][se storage=se054 nowait=1][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]Double mascots! Ugh, my life is a mess from making a contract with that thing!"::
15311::$$$message_0116_0176_0000$$$::...That's right.[lr]::
15312::$$$message_0116_0176_0001$$$::Tohsaka is the biggest victim here.[lr]::
15313::$$$message_0116_0176_0002$$$::I wasn't able to protect Tohsaka even while being by her side, so I need to at least be like a wall and listen to her complaints.::
15314::$$$message_0116_0177_0000$$$::"...Sorry. If I was more reliable, this wouldn't have happened.[lr]::
15315::$$$message_0116_0177_0001$$$::...Yeah. I'll find a way to cancel the contract with the wand with you from now on."[lr]::
15316::$$$message_0116_0177_0002$$$::I grab Tohsaka's hand.[lr]::
15317::$$$message_0116_0177_0003$$$::"More importantly, Tohsaka. Don't you have to go to the bathroom?"[lr]::
15318::$$$message_0116_0177_0004$$$::She's been trembling nonstop and seems to be in pain.::
15319::$$$message_0116_0178_0000$$$::"Ahahahahaha![lr]::
15320::$$$message_0116_0178_0001$$$::Get inside the box again, you stupid Shirou!!!!!"[lr]::
15321::$$$message_0116_0178_0002$$$::"W-Whyyyy!!!???"::
15322::$$$message_0116_0179_0000$$$::I brilliantly fall inside.[lr]::
15323::$$$message_0116_0179_0001$$$::Back inside the box, as I close my eyes thinking that I'll hit my head again...[lr]::
15324::$$$message_0116_0179_0002$$$::"Ah...!?"[lr]::
15325::$$$message_0116_0179_0003$$$::I collide into something soft.::
15326::$$$message_0116_0180_0000$$$::"...Oh?"[lr]::
15327::$$$message_0116_0180_0001$$$::That was unmistakably that person's voice.[lr]::
15328::$$$message_0116_0180_0002$$$::While thinking there isn't anyone in here anymore, I give up at the same time thinking that there aren't any legitimate rules in this box either.[lr]::
15329::$$$message_0116_0180_0003$$$::While being tormented with a bad feeling, I timidly look back.[lr]::
15330::$$$message_0116_0180_0004$$$::And...::
15331::$$$message_0116_0181_0000$$$::"...[wvl canskip=0 time=1500]Who are you?"[lr]::
15332::$$$message_0116_0181_0001$$$::There is...an unfamiliar lady in blue holding the Kaleidostick.::
15333::$$$message_0116_0182_0000$$$::...The storm continues.[lr]::
15334::$$$message_0116_0182_0001$$$::The trouble surrounding the box hasn't ended...::7�